M1 ON THREE POWER-PATH CASES AND ONE DERATED VARIANT, KEPT APART (three_cases.py, stream l3plane with r11dep, MESHSAT-1357).
PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing built, powered or measured. MODELED on a1elec's energy_two_pack.py through energy_basis.py's set-up
(pinned); the electrical limits from r11dep's r11_dep.out; every coverage figure is a MODELLED HISTORICAL COVERAGE, not a
success probability. The author's analysis, AI arithmetic; not a qualified review and not the independent check.

